      "message": "Not blocking: the review token lasts 30 minutes, but the job allows 45.\n\ngerrithub-ci\u0027s `MUSE_TOKEN_TTL_SECONDS` defaults to 1800, and Muse starts only after the setup steps. A long `xhigh` session with cold-cache builds will start getting 401s from `/v1` near its end, when most of its tokens are already spent, and nothing gets posted.\n\nFix: raise the Worker\u0027s TTL (it is capped at 3600), or make the job\u0027s and Muse\u0027s limits fit within 30 minutes.",
